{"strongs": "H6486", "word": "פְּקֻדָּה", "translit": "pe.qud.dah", "root": "פקד", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "oversight, mustering, visitation, store", "definition": "פְּקֻדָּה 32 noun feminine oversight, mustering, visitation, store ; — absolute ׳ פ Hos 9:7 ; 1Chr 23:11 construct פְּקֻדַּת Num 3:32 +; suffix פְּקֻדָּתוֺ Num 109:8 , etc.; plural פְּקֻדּ(וֺ)ת Jer 52:11 +; — 1. visitation: \\ \\ a. = punishment Hos 9:7 ; Isa 10:3 ; Mic 7:4 ; Ezek 9:1 ; Num 16:29 ( P ), especially in עֵת(שְׁנַתׅ פְּקֻדָּתָם Jer 8:12 ; Jer 10:15 + 6 t. Jeremiah (compare עֵת with פָּקַד Jer 6:15 ; Jer 49:8 ; Jer 50:31 ), ׳ בֵּית הַפּ = prison Jer 52:11 . \\ \\ b. gracious visitation, providence Job 10:12 . 2. a. oversight, charge Num 4:16 ( P ), also Num 3:36 ( P ; redund.), 1Chr 26:30 = office 2Chr 23:18 . \\ \\ b. overseer (abstract for concrete), 2Kgs 11:8 ; Ezek 44:11 (with אֶל of thing), Num 3:32 ( P ); collective = magistracy Isa 60:17 ( Lag BN 151 ), compare 2Chr 24:11 . \\ \\ c. class of officers 1Chr 23:11 ; 1Chr 24:3 ; 1Chr 24:19 . \\ \\ d. charge = thing entrusted Num 4:16 ( P ). 3. mustering 2Chr 17:14 ; 2Chr 26:11 . 4. store , things laid up, Isa 15:7 ; Ps 109:8 (perhaps; Hup We Skizzen vi. 184 and others office ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6735')\">BDB6735</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6486')\">H6486</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6734')\">BDB6734</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6736')\">BDB6736</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>פְּקֻדָּה</bdbheb><sub>32</sub> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>oversight, mustering, visitation, store</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 9:7\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(28,9,7)\">Hos 9:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,11)\">1Chr 23:11</ref> construct <bdbheb>פְּקֻדַּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 3:32\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,32)\">Num 3:32</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>פְּקֻדָּתוֺ</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Num 109:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"109\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"109\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,109,8)\">Num 109:8</ref>, etc.; plural <bdbheb>פְּקֻדּ(וֺ)ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 52:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,11)\">Jer 52:11</ref> +; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>visitation:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> = punishment <ref ref=\"Hos 9:7\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(28,9,7)\">Hos 9:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 10:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,3)\">Isa 10:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 7:4\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,4)\">Mic 7:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 9:1\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(26,9,1)\">Ezek 9:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 16:29\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,29)\">Num 16:29</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), especially in <bdbheb>עֵת(שְׁנַתׅ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>פְּקֻדָּתָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 8:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,12)\">Jer 8:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 10:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,15)\">Jer 10:15</ref> + 6 t. Jeremiah (compare <bdbheb>עֵת</bdbheb> with <bdbheb>פָּקַד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 6:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,6,15)\">Jer 6:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 49:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,8)\">Jer 49:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 50:31\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,31)\">Jer 50:31</ref>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בֵּית הַפּ</bdbheb> = prison <ref ref=\"Jer 52:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,11)\">Jer 52:11</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> gracious visitation, providence <ref ref=\"Job 10:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,10,12)\">Job 10:12</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2. a.</b> <highlight>oversight, charge</highlight> <ref ref=\"Num 4:16\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,16)\">Num 4:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), also <ref ref=\"Num 3:36\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,36)\">Num 3:36</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; redund.), <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:30\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,30)\">1Chr 26:30</ref> = <highlight>office</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Chr 23:18\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(14,23,18)\">2Chr 23:18</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>overseer</highlight> (abstract for concrete), <ref ref=\"2Kgs 11:8\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(12,11,8)\">2Kgs 11:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 44:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,44,11)\">Ezek 44:11</ref> (with <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> of thing), <ref ref=\"Num 3:32\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,32)\">Num 3:32</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); collective = magistracy <ref ref=\"Isa 60:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,17)\">Isa 60:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 151</sup></lookup>), compare <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,11)\">2Chr 24:11</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>class of officers</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,11)\">1Chr 23:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 24:3\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(13,24,3)\">1Chr 24:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 24:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,24,19)\">1Chr 24:19</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <highlight>charge</highlight> = thing entrusted <ref ref=\"Num 4:16\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,16)\">Num 4:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>mustering</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Chr 17:14\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(14,17,14)\">2Chr 17:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 26:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,26,11)\">2Chr 26:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>store</highlight>, things laid up, <ref ref=\"Isa 15:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,15,7)\">Isa 15:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 109:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"109\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"109\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,109,8)\">Ps 109:8</ref> (perhaps; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hup')\">Hup</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We<sup>Skizzen vi. 184</sup></lookup> and others <highlight>office</highlight>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Hos 9:7", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 9, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "1Chr 23:11", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 23, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Num 3:32", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 3, "verse": 32}, {"raw": "Num 109:8", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 109, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Jer 52:11", "book": "JER", "chapter": 52, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Isa 10:3", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 10, "